# Build context of the images (context = the repository root, or `git archive HEAD` from build-images.sh):
# portal/deploy/kubernetes/Dockerfile reads this file;
# portal/apps/runner/Dockerfile has its own (Dockerfile.dockerignore, BuildKit) and falls back to this one otherwise.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.log
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/routeTree.gen.ts
# Secrets and databases at any depth (build-images.sh builds from `git archive HEAD`, which never has them; this is for
# a plain `docker build` of a working tree).
.git
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.local
**/*.pem
**/*.pfx
**/*.key
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
portal/apps/runner/modules
docs
.claude
# The tests package is a workspace member (pnpm checks the lockfile against its manifest); nothing else of it ships.
tests/**
!tests/package.json
